---
description: CyberSkill Design System (@cyberskill/design): use its components and tokens for all UI
globs: ["**/*.tsx", "**/*.jsx", "**/*.css", "**/*.mdx"]
alwaysApply: false
---

This project uses @cyberskill/design. Before writing or changing UI, read `node_modules/@cyberskill/design/ai/INDEX.md`, then only the `ai/components/<name>.md` files you need. Follow its rules: components before custom UI, tokens only (no hex or Tailwind palette colors), flat named imports, visible labels, status with icon + text.
